  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> be a common tangent line to the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn></math>. Then the square of the slope of the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> is ______.<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given curves are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>31</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>let slope of common tangent be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math></p><p>so tangents are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>31</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>31</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
